# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Only NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY may ever be
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ (enforced by scripts/check-public-env.mjs).
# There is no service-role key: the app only talks to Supabase as the signed-in user.
# Login is Google OAuth via Supabase Auth (enable the provider in the Supabase dashboard).

# Server-only. uuid of the one household allowed to use the server-wide costs sheet (COSTS_SHEET_ID)
# and the paid AI features. Leave unset to switch both off for every household.
# PRIMARY_HOUSEHOLD_ID=

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
